---
title: Beer Batter
source: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/12824/beer-batter/
servings: 8
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 0 minutes
---

Combine @all-purpose flour{1%cup}, @egg{1}(beaten), @garlic powder{1%tsp}, and @ground black pepper{1/2%tsp} in a #medium bowl{}. Whisk in @beer{1%cup} until smooth. Thin batter with up to 1/2 cup additional beer, if desired.
